      "content": "that's pretty good. helps set the tone. i want to dive into a specific topic for the first episode though. i was thinking about all these new regulations and spending bills they keep passing. can you write a segment where the host talks about how these 'experts' in the city think they know what's best for us, but they're actually just making life harder for normal families? try to make it sound really conviction-heavy, like there's no two ways about it.",
